{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は会社で\n納会があったよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も1年お疲れ様でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんのところも\n今日が仕事納めって方、\n多かったんじゃないかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年末年始は身体を\n労わるよう\nゆっくり休んで下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに私は\n年末にかけて感謝祭だの\nいろいろあるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の方の仕事納めは\nまだまだかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひかないよう\n頑張るね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握@名古屋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"23日は個別握手会でした。\n名古屋の皆さんお久ぶりです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は\nクリスマスが近いということで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年に引き続き\nサンタさんに成りすましました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうですか？？？\n昨年よりグレードアップ\nしてましたか～？？？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにね、\n予めブログで\nサンタ予告してたからか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの人が\n会いに来てくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな素直すぎるよ。\n可愛いよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして玲香さんと\nまさかのサンタ被りっっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGOの最終回\n出てなかったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼントされてたなんて\n知らなかったよ！(◎_◎;)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと量販店で買ったの\n恥ずかしいよ！(◎_◎;)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の握手会も楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな方とお話出来るのは\n本当に楽しいし、\n勉強になるし、\n支えられてるなあと\n改めて思いますp(^_^)q"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年も張り切って\nサンタさんになるので\nよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回は12/28の京都！\n今年最後！\n待ってて下さいp(^_^)q"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミュージックソン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12/24.25は\nラジオ チャリティー\nミュージックソンでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニッポン放送の関連会社で\n働いてるので、\n募金の電話受付を\nやってきました～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメとか755では\n発信していたので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"募金してくださった方もいて、\n本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"24日は高橋みなみさんの\nお隣で電話受付やってたんですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもお優しい方でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真取れば良かった、、、\nと後悔しております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも\nゆずさん\n大竹しのぶさん\n藤井フミヤさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"など\nたくさんの有名人の方達が\n電話受けをやっていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中でもオードリーさんは\n電話受付ですら面白かった。\nずるい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この電話ではね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"募金の他に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声や音に助けられた話、\n声や音に勇気付けられた話も\nお聞きするんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人1人に\nいろんな思いがあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リスナーさんは本当に\nニッポン放送が大好きで、\n少しでも力になればと思って\n電話してきてくれるんだなと..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段は知り合えない\n様々な方のお話を聴けて\nとても感慨深かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方のお話を\n聞きましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"主婦の方だったかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオは耳からしか情報を\n得られないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発せられた言葉から\n最大限のことを読み取ろうとするのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからラジオはパーソナリティと\nリスナーとの距離が近いの。\n心の影響力が大きいの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と話してくれる方がいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電話越しでもその言葉の重みが\n伝わってきて\n本当に心に刺さりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に素敵な会社で働かせて\n頂いてるな。私は。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、私も誰かの心に\n刺さるような\n素敵な言葉を紡いでいきたいと\n改めて思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミュージックソンで\nラジオがまた少し好きになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年は出られたらいいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目の不自由な方へ、\n音の出る信号機を！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な経験になりました！\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n今日はこの辺でおしまいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また更新します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/12/27/1081612/0010.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}